# Copy to .env (mode 600, gitignored) and fill in. `ownbox.sh setup` does the
# copy when there is no .env yet.
#
# SIP_* and TELEGRAM_* moved to hotline-call with the phone calls on
# 2026-10-31; its setup copies them out of an existing .env here.

# Same gate as hotlined: a source-IP allowlist on top of a Tailscale-only bind.
# Loopback is always allowed regardless, so a blocked agent on this box is never
# locked out of the phone by the allowlist that exists to keep others out.
HOTLINE_ALLOW_IPS=100.108.255.28
# Optional second factor, sent as X-Hotline-Key. hotline-calld must be given
# the same value: the two daemons authenticate to each other with it.
HOTLINE_API_KEY=
# Where hotline-calld listens, if not 127.0.0.1:8792.
# HOTLINE_IOS_CALLD_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8792
